        Defense. Unlocks NA 4-6. Dimension Cut heals Main for 8% of damage dealt.
        Shadow Meter gain is doubled while Main is inside Void Area. Perform 5 paid
        Dimension Cuts to open a 1.5s Skill follow-up for Judgment Cut.
      track: 2
      level: 4
      fragmentCost: 1
      unlockedByDefault: 0
